{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The control ambiguity is now resolved experimentally. Only the leftmost color-8 object at pixel `(3,3)` changes gravity; the apparent “controls” across the top are overlays on ordinary color-12 supports, and clicking their centers only expands those supports. This is why the existing lattice-only search never generated a gravity action. I’m adding one optional edge-control action to the same reusable search and will verify the resulting route before wiring level 7."}}
